e on the Mediterranean. The Ionian Sea is west of the mainland, Albania northwest, and North Macedonia and Bulgaria north. Turkey is east both by land and the Aegean Sea. The capital, Athens, is the largest Greek city, followed by Thessaloniki and Patras.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Greece","source":"Wikipedia","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","iso2":"GR"}],"arc":{"reports":2,"first_seen":"2026-10-26T22:10:23Z","first_title":"Turkey-Libya maritime boundaries deal 'remains null and void,' Greek foreign minister says","first_url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxQc0VETzViMlFHOHlCMTg0MnJ2ZE5QXzR5ZXhOUjNCRmFqWkxuUUZNcmVlQ0pPYktJVmt0MVFvQzRNRmN4a2haQnBneG1SSF9zOXdyS19RT1VfeW9fbk1XODVnOHFkaU1ReGgybVdSbnZTbDVYNE1ZZUZmRTdQLXpPOUNJVlhOTmkteE0xWHBOV3oydmd1dVRCN0xwaWJuVzYtaU9KU2dwSGhYVHM3eG5oQXQ4MldLQjc1ZTVoT3hLaGg?oc=5","first_publisher":"Euronews.com","earlier":[{"id":"e_2d39ca96647c","title":"Turkey-Libya maritime boundaries deal 'remains null and void,' Greek foreign minister says","date":"2026-10-26T22:10:23Z","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxQc0VETzViMlFHOHlCMTg0MnJ2ZE5QXzR5ZXhOUjNCRmFqWkxuUUZNcmVlQ0pPYktJVmt0MVFvQzRNRmN4a2haQnBneG1SSF9zOXdyS19RT1VfeW9fbk1XODVnOHFkaU1ReGgybVdSbnZTbDVYNE1ZZUZmRTdQLXpPOUNJVlhOTmkteE0xWHBOV3oydmd1dVRCN0xwaWJuVzYtaU9KU2dwSGhYVHM3eG5oQXQ4MldLQjc1ZTVoT3hLaGg?oc=5","publisher":"Euronews.com","verification":"single_source_report"},{"id":"e_792175a17df4","title":"Greece urges action on Libya-Turkey pact, Red Sea shipping threats","date":"2026-10-30T07:05:07Z","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxOWTY4QWg3Uy0yNGNndnF0dEFxZW8xTXlGYU5XRGxSNl9YTWR4ZnhVdFpaWHB5QUR0bnNpaWFwc2JtZmdHbFBBVDNBVnhraFk3d3ZiN1lUTFYyNFd0MmJ0aEw3eVdMa3VKSERfU0dBMHl0UjBGZUNzM0ZYaG5qcWhKMERfOGgxZEc0NjR2elljVmEwNVVpSmZXc2h1ZnY?oc=5","publisher":"Middle East Online","verification":"single_source_report"}],"weekly":[["2026-10-26",2]],"window_days":45}}}